of Anthropic, subject to Anthropic's terms, and is not distributed here. The type
declarations that Claude Code writes next to a mod (.claude-plugin/types/) are not
redistributed: see the README.

The failure checklist and the two-level research loop in programme/methode.json
("greffes_h2") are inspired by the paper Harness^2 (Google Research, arXiv:2610.14224).
No text or code of that paper is included.

The template programme/gabarits/arbre-definitions.html links the Google Fonts stylesheet for the fonts
Fraunces, Source Sans 3 and JetBrains Mono (SIL Open Font License 1.1). The fonts are loaded from Google at
display time and are not distributed in this repository.
